# Original PICO question schematic; not randomization, execution or effect data.
direction: down
population: "P: population\nand context"
intervention: "I: intervention"
comparator: "C: comparator"
outcome: "O: outcomes\nand assessment time"
question: "Explicit review question\nnot an observed study"
population -> intervention: question about
population -> comparator: question about
intervention -> outcome: evaluate against C
comparator -> outcome: baseline for comparison
outcome -> question: specify before search
